    "8fffa647b9b8a39b3821a0c434348808c04d4c50": {
        "source": "[us] [says] that Officer [3rd] [has] caught wind of some of [them-pos] dealings. But seeing as Officer [3rd] [is] a friend, [us] might be able to throw [3rd-pos] off the scent. Assuming [them] [is] willing to play nice.",
