    "040c99c4bf2f5e4001e509f5403ec4e211a103a5": {
        "source": "[us] [says] that [us-subj] made enough on [us-pos] last job to buy a place on Tharsis Landing. Not that a backwater scrapper like [them] would know where that is.",
        "translation": "[us] [says] que [us-subj] a gagné assez sur [us-pos] dernier emploi pour acheter un logement à Tharsis Landing. Non pas qu'un ferrailleur comme [them] sache où cela se trouve.",
        "field": "strDesc",
