    "d3005feb32eab1ee37bd571cbf99afaf9627b615": {
        "source": "PRISONER_INFO_HELIOHORA.TXT",
        "translation": "PRISONER_INFO_HELIOHORA.TXT",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[1].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "53a9d803470e08d34192df22995b87fc2fa9227c": {
        "source": "Helio Hora, former head of the Briar Rose criminal syndicate. Given that Hora was born in 2023 in Sao Paulo on Earth, details of his early life are mostly unknown. In the early days of Venusian aerostat development, Hora worked in contracting and eventually materials acquisition, and was thus vital in the construction of both NewCal and Encantado.\n\nUsing resources and relationships cultivated in the construction of the latter, Hora began the Grande Prêmio do Encantado and eventually established the nearby Sol Vermelho Lounge. According to the case built against him by law enforcement, at the time of his arrest Hora's criminal empire included race fixing, labor bribery, contract embezzlement, intimidation, piracy, and contract killing.\n\nAs part of the terms of his arrest, most of Hora's assets were turned over to a prominent Venusian business mogul, including ownership of the Sol Vermelho Lounge.",
        "translation": "Helio Hora, ancien chef du syndicat criminel Briar Rose. Étant donné qu'Hora est né en 2023 à Sao Paulo sur Terre, les détails de sa jeunesse sont pour la plupart inconnus. Dans les premiers jours du développement des aérostats vénusiens, Hora a travaillé dans la sous-traitance et finalement dans l'acquisition de matériaux, et a donc joué un rôle vital dans la construction de NewCal et d'Encantado.\n\nUtilisant les ressources et les relations cultivées lors de la construction de ce dernier, Hora a lancé le Grande Prêmio do Encantado et a finalement créé le salon Sol Vermelho à proximité. Selon le dossier construit contre lui par les forces de l'ordre, au moment de son arrestation, l'empire criminel de Hora comprenait la manipulation raciale, la corruption au travail, le détournement de contrats, l'intimidation, le piratage et le meurtre sous contrat.\n\nDans le cadre des conditions de son arrestation, la plupart des actifs de Hora ont été remis à un éminent magnat des affaires vénusien, y compris la propriété du salon Sol Vermelho.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[1].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
