    "37e509f0ccf1ffdbe0fd88587f04594a151b47a2": {
        "source": "DND Cola",
        "translation": "Cola du MDN",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[119].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "cc32dff6908a201428315ac3678b68516ed1e795": {
        "source": "Do Not Drink Cola is an energy drink, the namesake brand of the DND Group. It is the most popular energy drink, and the second most popular carbonated beverage sold in the System. It is known for its innovative marketing strategy that leverages health risks instead of downplaying them. It is widely consumed by shift workers and long haulers.\n\n<b>Type:</b> Energy drink\n<b>Manufacturer:</b> DND Group\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Sweden\n<b>Variants:</b> DND-Toxic, DND-Lemon\n<b>Produced in:</b> Suzhou Orbital; Daedalia Planum\n<b>Key people:</b> Annika Engstrom (CEO)\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> DNDR\n\n<b>Slogans:</b>\nDo not drink this cola.\nUnfit for human consumption.\nWarning: Highly Dangerous.\nOnly Use In Case of Emergency",
        "translation": "Do Not Drink Cola is an energy drink, the namesake brand of the DND Group. It is the most popular energy drink, and the second most popular carbonated beverage sold in the System. It is known for its innovative marketing strategy that leverages health risks instead of downplaying them. It is widely consumed by shift workers and long haulers.\n\n<b>Type:</b> Energy drink\n<b>Manufacturer:</b> DND Group\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Sweden\n<b>Variants:</b> DND-Toxic, DND-Lemon\n<b>Produced in:</b> Suzhou Orbital; Daedalia Planum\n<b>Key people:</b> Annika Engstrom (CEO)\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> DNDR\n\n<b>Slogans:</b>\nDo not drink this cola.\nUnfit for human consumption.\nWarning: Highly Dangerous.\nOnly Use In Case of Emergency",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[119].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "62bcb84500608d3a95b9a5da468f583316124763": {
        "source": "DataWIKIDNDColaHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIDNDColaHistorique",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[119].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "b31ab4f1f4cda94d03aa95052d1b3cb46588af9a": {
        "source": "DND Cola History",
        "translation": "Histoire du Cola du MDN",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[120].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "36c407f2330f901d46aaae81d2264c221dbb611f": {
        "source": "Product safety requirements were one of the slowest-traveling of Earth's laws in the colony rush, and chemist Jens Nyburg capitalised on it. In a vat borrowed from his company, he brewed a cola derivative mixed with methylphenidate, and sold the drink to his working group. Its explosive popularity attracted the attention of distributors, and Nyburg sold his creation to Lagom Holdings.\n\n<b>Marketing:</b>\n\nThe unconventional brand styling was designed by creative marketing agency Fast Times.\n\nWhen regulatory agencies caught up with the colonisation effort, prohibition proved impossible due to the entrenched popularity of the beverage, then called MPD Cola. A compromise agreement led to prominent health warnings being displayed on the can. Fast Times' marketing strategy turned the agreement on its head, making the health risks and warnings the product's unique selling point. A combination of continually weakening regulatory bodies, corporate influence, and public fondness for the product, has postponed further regulation.",
        "translation": "Les exigences en matière de sécurité des produits étaient l'une des lois terrestres les plus lentes à évoluer dans la ruée vers les colonies, et le chimiste Jens Nyburg en a profité. Dans une cuve empruntée à son entreprise, il brassait un dérivé de cola mélangé à du méthylphénidate et vendait la boisson à son groupe de travail. Sa popularité explosive a attiré l'attention des distributeurs et Nyburg a vendu sa création à Lagom Holdings.\n\n<b>Marketing :</b>\n\nLe style non conventionnel de la marque a été conçu par l'agence de marketing créatif Fast Times.\n\nLorsque les agences de régulation ont rattrapé l’effort de colonisation, l’interdiction s’est avérée impossible en raison de la popularité bien ancrée de la boisson, alors appelée MPD Cola. Un accord de compromis a conduit à l’affichage d’avertissements sanitaires bien visibles sur la canette. La stratégie marketing de Fast Times a renversé l'accord, faisant des risques pour la santé et des avertissements l'unique argument de vente du produit. Une combinaison de l’affaiblissement continu des organismes de réglementation, de l’influence des entreprises et de l’attrait du public pour le produit a retardé la poursuite de la réglementation.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[120].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "e985fe47e1f613338eef155af4e0faf369713515": {
        "source": "DataWIKIDNDCola",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIDNDCola",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[120].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "c79f8283912632bda6ac4ca6d94435e5c38e5d2f": {
        "source": "Hyun Lee Petware",
        "translation": "Hyun Lee Petware",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[121].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "bfd3f6e91da8ce10a3e16cbd5068951a7a205802": {
        "source": "Hyun Lee Petware Inc. is an applied genetics company which specialises in the synthesis and artificial cultivation of animals. Petware’s designs are considered state of the art and their products are highly sought after. In spite of high demand, Petware makes bespoke animals, which has led to many imitators.\n <b>Product:</b> Artificial animals & pets\n <b>Origin:</b> Kapyong Station\n <b>Key people:</b> Alice Ding (CEO), Park Hyun Lee (CDO, majority shareholder)\n <b>Ticker Symbol:</b> HPET",
        "translation": "Hyun Lee Petware Inc. est une entreprise de génétique appliquée spécialisée dans la synthèse et la culture artificielle d'animaux. Les conceptions de Petware sont considérées comme à la pointe de la technologie et leurs produits sont très recherchés. Malgré une forte demande, Petware fabrique des animaux sur mesure, ce qui a suscité de nombreux imitateurs.\n <b>Produit :</b> Animaux et animaux de compagnie artificiels\n <b>Origine :</b> Gare de Kapyong\n <b>Personnes clés :</b> Alice Ding (PDG), Park Hyun Lee (CDO, actionnaire majoritaire)\n <b>Symbole boursier :</b> HPET",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[121].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "34a6878181c06d470a35e16adc8238434d3af5a5": {
        "source": "DataWIKIHyunLeePetwareHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIHyunLeePetwareHistorique",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[121].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "63225226c51107338a8629e61510985ec3e9e346": {
        "source": "DataWIKIHyunLeePetwareCatalogue",
        "translation": "DataWIKIHyunLeePetwareCatalogue",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[121].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "3c8b62ef8bfa1024f7cac6c08aeda5d9410cd403": {
        "source": "Hyun Lee Petware History",
        "translation": "Histoire de Hyun Lee Petware",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[122].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "4207c9a05cfcd18b83488f979662028c22226ea7": {
        "source": "Park Hyun Lee first gained public notoriety as a professor of genetics at the Korean School for Biotechnology, when his views and unsanctioned experiments on animals and gene splicing were made public. Shortly thereafter his experiments were terminated and his doctorate was revoked. Notably, and perhaps ironically, his residence was vandalised with goat’s blood. Choosing to emigrate off world, Hyun Lee continued his work privately in the relaxed legal environment of Kapyong Station. Future CEO Alice Ding, then a financial analyst, overheard about Hyun Lee in station rumours. She approached him and offered him six months of work for free, and made a personal commitment to reverse his image. Hyun Lee was disinterested but afraid of running afoul of yet more controversy, and so accepted her offer. Six months later, proceeds from Hyun Lee Petware’s IPO on the ISSX rose to $5 billion.",
        "translation": "Park Hyun Lee a d'abord acquis une notoriété publique en tant que professeur de génétique à l'École coréenne de biotechnologie, lorsque ses opinions et ses expériences non autorisées sur les animaux et l'épissage des gènes ont été rendues publiques. Peu de temps après, ses expériences furent interrompues et son doctorat révoqué. Notamment, et peut-être ironiquement, sa résidence a été vandalisée avec du sang de chèvre. Choisissant d'émigrer hors du monde, Hyun Lee a poursuivi son travail en privé dans l'environnement juridique détendu de la gare de Kapyong. La future PDG Alice Ding, alors analyste financière, a entendu parler de Hyun Lee dans les rumeurs de la station. Elle l'a approché et lui a proposé six mois de travail gratuits et s'est engagée personnellement à inverser son image. Hyun Lee était désintéressé mais craignait de se heurter à une nouvelle controverse et a donc accepté son offre. Six mois plus tard, le produit de l’introduction en bourse de Hyun Lee Petware sur l’ISSX s’élevait à 5 milliards de dollars.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[122].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
