    "7dd19b731de6c6e31744bad1072801ceeffa8829": {
        "source": "Peacock Pictures",
        "translation": "Photos De Paon",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[140].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "e186a469d4c4da0b0d9f3d6548b9efddee595846": {
        "source": "Peacock Pictures Incorporated is a Xinhuan media studio, production company, and distributor. It is one of the biggest media companies in the System, and a hybrid producer of 'new' and 'old' media. It is most well-known for its feature films, and for its association with a group of directors, actors, and technical directors known as 右岸派, or 'Right Bankers'.\n\nType: Media producer, distributor\nAlternate names: Kongque Yingye Youxian Gongsi (孔雀影业有限公司)\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Xinhua, Mars\n<b>Headquarters:</b> Pavonis Mons\n<b>Key people:</b> Wei Cheng (president), Di Yaote (chief creative officer)\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> PECK\n\n<b>Films and Taglines:</b>\n\nThose With Loaded Guns\n'Take the secret to the grave.'\n\nThe Disconnect\n'Those who know don't talk. And those that talk don't know.'\n\nTimelock\n'It was just a simple heist. Now it's anything but.'\n\nDiamonds in the Rough\n'He loved she who loved only money.'\n\nSouthern Highland\n'There's a long long way to fall.'",
        "translation": "Peacock Pictures Incorporated is a Xinhuan media studio, production company, and distributor. It is one of the biggest media companies in the System, and a hybrid producer of 'new' and 'old' media. It is most well-known for its feature films, and for its association with a group of directors, actors, and technical directors known as 右岸派, or 'Right Bankers'.\n\nType: Media producer, distributor\nAlternate names: Kongque Yingye Youxian Gongsi (孔雀影业有限公司)\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Xinhua, Mars\n<b>Headquarters:</b> Pavonis Mons\n<b>Key people:</b> Wei Cheng (president), Di Yaote (chief creative officer)\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> PECK\n\n<b>Films and Taglines:</b>\n\nThose With Loaded Guns\n'Take the secret to the grave.'\n\nThe Disconnect\n'Those who know don't talk. And those that talk don't know.'\n\nTimelock\n'It was just a simple heist. Now it's anything but.'\n\nDiamonds in the Rough\n'He loved she who loved only money.'\n\nSouthern Highland\n'There's a long long way to fall.'",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[140].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "c32e75ade8c8701c04f2079e11ff2f76a6d2270b": {
        "source": "DataWIKIPeacockPicturesHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIPaonPhotosHistorique",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[140].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "e460591876627e02c00c4f6d1be7c8bdaf149f42": {
        "source": "DataWIKIPeacockPicturesMarketing",
        "translation": "DataWIKIPeacockPicturesMarketing",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[140].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "488903e4e0ba4dcd7df650a43a2cd5fb8d84b291": {
        "source": "Peacock Pictures History",
        "translation": "Histoire des photos de paon",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[141].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "ae54e0304b731cc0080059b736de0e2b03a76065": {
        "source": "Peacock Pictures was founded by Xinhua Arts Council to attract filmmakers in Pavonis Mons with the promise of funding assistance and creative freedom. For years the project was deemed a failure by Xinhua representatives, and president Wei Cheng was threatened with removal fourteen times while resisting the influence of her government. In press statements she referred to this period as 'riding the tiger'.\n\nThe project's success was gradual rather than overnight. Its growth continued long after becoming profitable. Helping the climb was its growing stable of creative producers, the Right Bank, including directors like Di Yaote and Zhou Feifei, and the acting power couple Benedict Lam and Dalisay. The breakout success of plains thriller Those With Loaded Guns is regarded as Peacock Pictures' watershed moment, and the codification if not the origin of the 'plains' genre.",
        "translation": "Peacock Pictures a été fondée par le Conseil des Arts de Xinhua pour attirer les cinéastes à Pavonis Mons avec la promesse d'une aide financière et d'une liberté de création. Pendant des années, le projet a été considéré comme un échec par les représentants de Xinhua, et la présidente Wei Cheng a été menacée de destitution à quatorze reprises alors qu'elle résistait à l'influence de son gouvernement. Dans des déclarations à la presse, elle a qualifié cette période de « chevauchée sur le tigre ».\n\nLe succès du projet s'est fait progressivement plutôt que du jour au lendemain. Sa croissance s'est poursuivie longtemps après être devenue rentable. Cette ascension a été facilitée par son groupe croissant de producteurs créatifs, la Rive Droite, comprenant des réalisateurs comme Di Yaote et Zhou Feifei, et le couple d'acteurs Benedict Lam et Dalisay. Le succès retentissant du thriller des plaines These With Loaded Guns est considéré comme le moment décisif de Peacock Pictures et la codification, sinon l'origine, du genre « des plaines ».",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[141].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "683c07ffb388ebbbe25cf5591d3f092cbf349e46": {
        "source": "DataWIKIPeacockPictures",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIPaonPhotos",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[141].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "0229265ab3fe9af626091e3f0fbd3af912af7f29": {
        "source": "DataWIKIPeacockPicturesMarketing",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIPaonPhotosMarketing",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[141].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "05e857af9249b38c16f499a43ec58d8cee231041": {
        "source": "Peacock Pictures Marketing",
        "translation": "Marketing de photos de paon",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[142].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "74b3d6857b9f139a6b097f50cb61c02c58e724c0": {
        "source": "The creative freedom of Peacock allowed it license and a budget to do as it pleased, in spite of voices in the Arts Council demanding historical dramas and 'classic science fiction' to compete with the output of the Western studios. Wei Cheng wanted to establish a visual language and a foundation myth for new generations living on Mars. She forced the internal ideological battle into the public eye, where it struck a chord with Martian colonists.\n\nThe lives of the creatives are subject to constant tabloid scrutiny, paparazzi, and social media debate. This is encouraged by Peacock, who curate fandoms, inviting audiences into the production process and behind the scenes. The effect is that celebrities seem like close friends of their fans, and in some cases, they are.",
        "translation": "La liberté créative de Peacock lui a permis de disposer d'une licence et d'un budget pour faire ce qu'il voulait, malgré les voix au sein de l'Arts Council exigeant que les drames historiques et la « science-fiction classique » rivalisent avec la production des studios occidentaux. Wei Cheng souhaitait établir un langage visuel et un mythe fondateur pour les nouvelles générations vivant sur Mars. Elle a fait connaître la bataille idéologique interne au public, où elle a touché une corde sensible chez les colons martiens.\n\nLa vie des créatifs est soumise à un examen constant des tabloïds, des paparazzi et des débats sur les réseaux sociaux. Ceci est encouragé par Peacock, qui organise des fandoms, invitant le public à participer au processus de production et dans les coulisses. L’effet est que les célébrités semblent être des amis proches de leurs fans, et dans certains cas, elles le sont.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[142].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "3d52072187029334a4a6656f1297f72a76940c7b": {
        "source": "DataWIKIPeacockPictures",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIPaonPhotos",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[142].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "7c05cb47425891238e8884bbb6b290188c387223": {
        "source": "DataWIKIPeacockPicturesHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIPaonPhotosHistorique",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[142].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "3364d071c0dfe678c69ec2fe469cad9eaa354aa0": {
        "source": "Renbao Smart Technologies",
        "translation": "Technologies intelligentes Renbao",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[143].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "6472fc7b2fc07e1d1996b41ee6c2b59f085b42b0": {
        "source": "Renbao Smart Technologies Inc. (RST) is an unbordered technology company headquartered in Shenzhen and Suzhou Orbital, with operations in over two hundred countries, off world colonies, and corporate territories. RST's design philosophy is led by the principles of neuromorphology, interconnectivity, and user symbiosis. Its hardware products include the Portal smartphone, the 机 ('Engine' or 'G series') laptop, the 牖 ('Lattice') tablet, and their associated augmented reality peripherals. RST is the leading subsidiary of the Renbao conglomerate.\n\n<b>Industry:</b> Consumer electronics\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Old China\n<b>Key people:</b> Xu Xiang (CEO), Cheng Xiaoli (CFO), Lai Ying Ho (CDO)\n<b>Parent Company:</b> Renbao\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> REST\n\n<b>Slogans:</b>\nRST. The future's key.",
        "translation": "Renbao Smart Technologies Inc. (RST) est une société technologique sans frontières dont le siège est à Shenzhen et Suzhou Orbital, avec des opérations dans plus de deux cents pays, hors des colonies mondiales et des territoires d'entreprises. La philosophie de conception de RST est guidée par les principes de neuromorphologie, d'interconnectivité et de symbiose entre les utilisateurs. Ses produits matériels comprennent le smartphone Portal, l'ordinateur portable 机 (« Engine » ou « série G »), la tablette 牖 (« Lattice ») et leurs périphériques de réalité augmentée associés. RST est la première filiale du conglomérat Renbao.\n\n<b>Industrie :</b> Electronique grand public\n<b>Pays d'origine :</b> Ancienne Chine\n<b>Personnes clés :</b> Xu Xiang (PDG), Cheng Xiaoli (CFO), Lai Ying Ho (CDO)\n<b>Société mère :</b> Renbao\n<b>Symbole boursier :</b> REPOS\n\n<b>Slogans :</b>\nTVD. La clé du futur.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[143].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "412ba97dd97ac4c030b5fa5fabb24fab1eadab8e": {
        "source": "DataWIKIRenbaoHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIRenbaoHistorique",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[143].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "9108a7825ad56c59368afdce5fdb89624d8fa054": {
        "source": "Renbao History",
        "translation": "Histoire de Renbao",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[144].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "26c02e15938026f7a0758ca11101eb5975f2b6c4": {
        "source": "RST was founded in 2027 by Renbao Semiconductor Fabrication at the tail of the 20s fab boom. Its goal was to explore alternative computing architecture in the face of the rising costs of lithographic processes. While designing tests for a system in development, Lai Ying Ho, then a Junior Engineer, developed the predictive-priority-interface as a tool to assist her own work, populating it with surveillance data taken of herself. Her tool was soon in use by her coworkers. Anecdotal accounts have an unknown manager misunderstanding the interface's origin and threatening to fire the entire floor for corporate espionage. When the directors realised the interface could become a mainstream success, they integrated it into their next-generation flagship devices. RST's first major release, the 公式 ('Formula') smartphone, leapfrogged competition, setting industry standards of usability and performance.\n\nRST soon expanded into disparate software and hardware fields such as artificial intelligence, cloud computing, high velocity data, cryptography, cybernetics, and wearable technologies. In 2050 Renbao Semiconductor Fabrication restructured itself to refocus the company's mission, renaming itself 'Renbao' and giving RST the remit to pursue its focus on the consumer electronics environment. Renbao was one of the major investors in the construction of Suzhou Orbital, and today monopolises 6% of its interior surface area.",
        "translation": "RST a été fondée en 2027 par Renbao Semiconductor Fabrication, à la fin du boom des fabriques des années 20. Son objectif était d'explorer une architecture informatique alternative face aux coûts croissants des processus lithographiques. Lors de la conception de tests pour un système en développement, Lai Ying Ho, alors ingénieure junior, a développé l'interface de priorité prédictive comme un outil pour l'aider dans son propre travail, en la remplissant de données de surveillance prises sur elle-même. Son outil fut bientôt utilisé par ses collègues. Des récits anecdotiques indiquent qu'un responsable inconnu comprend mal l'origine de l'interface et menace de licencier tout l'étage pour espionnage industriel. Lorsque les réalisateurs ont réalisé que l'interface pouvait devenir un succès grand public, ils l'ont intégrée dans leurs appareils phares de nouvelle génération. La première version majeure de RST, le smartphone 公式 (« Formule »), a devancé la concurrence, établissant les normes de l'industrie en matière de convivialité et de performances.\n\nRST s'est rapidement étendu à des domaines logiciels et matériels disparates tels que l'intelligence artificielle, le cloud computing, les données à grande vitesse, la cryptographie, la cybernétique et les technologies portables. En 2050, Renbao Semiconductor Fabrication s'est restructurée pour recentrer la mission de l'entreprise, en se rebaptisant « Renbao » et en donnant à RST le mandat de poursuivre sa concentration sur l'environnement de l'électronique grand public. Renbao a été l'un des principaux investisseurs dans la construction de Suzhou Orbital et monopolise aujourd'hui 6 % de sa superficie intérieure.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[144].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "fefef429fe5a10088cf3cce9de6bd3bd7136a91e": {
        "source": "DataWIKIRenbao",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKIRenbao",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[144].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "0665951a906ff259cc83c401f8494302643f9d71": {
        "source": "Sungura Viceroys",
        "translation": "Vice-rois Sungura",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[145].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "313cc71d3cfa1c9e0da695fd2940e629757d9181": {
        "source": "Sungura Viceroys is a brand of cigarettes manufactured by Sungura Limited, a company from Old Kenya. Viceroys are known for their raw cut and flavour, Sungura's distinctive mascot, and the \"Viceroy's orders\" gesture associated with their use.\n\n<b>Product:</b> Cigarette\n<b>Manufacturer:</b> Sungura Limited\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Old Kenya\n<b>Variants:</b> Viceroy's Menthols, Viceroy's Greens\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> SUNG\n\n<b>Slogans:</b>Smoke break. Viceroy's orders.\nFor the long burn home.\nYou earned a break.nSweeter than oxygen.",
        "translation": "Sungura Viceroys is a brand of cigarettes manufactured by Sungura Limited, a company from Old Kenya. Viceroys are known for their raw cut and flavour, Sungura's distinctive mascot, and the \"Viceroy's orders\" gesture associated with their use.\n\n<b>Product:</b> Cigarette\n<b>Manufacturer:</b> Sungura Limited\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Old Kenya\n<b>Variants:</b> Viceroy's Menthols, Viceroy's Greens\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> SUNG\n\n<b>Slogans:</b>Smoke break. Viceroy's orders.\nFor the long burn home.\nYou earned a break.nSweeter than oxygen.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[145].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "2eba5013b26d9b826695a86f77098f65a50ddf97": {
        "source": "DataWIKISunguraViceroysHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKISunguraViceroisHistoire",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[145].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "8286b7bc3f62f6dc96274827877023474f208ef5": {
        "source": "DataWIKISunguraViceroysMarketing",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKISunguraViceroysMarketing",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[145].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "7eb82684b6c68182b3b46646f1da4b8328ad85c6": {
        "source": "Sungura Viceroys History",
        "translation": "Histoire des vice-rois de Sungura",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[146].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "4c38f7002823293452e3463f24084079753acc92": {
        "source": "The Viceroys brand was created during the Central African States' economic boom in the early colonisation rush. Urbanization and international investment into areas like Nairobi, Kinshasa, and Dar es Salaam created a new suburban working class. Sungura targeted their line of cigarettes at this new market.\n\nMass emigration from Africa brought Viceroys to space workers and long haul workers. In 2062 the Colonial Trade Commission investigated the popularity of the cigarette among environmental technicians, and a correlation between the cigarette's increasing market share and the rising maintenance costs and failure rates of CO2 scrubbers. The investigation is ongoing, though no action has been taken against Sungura over this issue.",
        "translation": "La marque Viceroys a été créée lors du boom économique des États d’Afrique centrale, au début de la ruée vers la colonisation. L'urbanisation et les investissements internationaux dans des régions comme Nairobi, Kinshasa et Dar es Salaam ont créé une nouvelle classe ouvrière de banlieue. Sungura a ciblé sa gamme de cigarettes sur ce nouveau marché.\n\nL'émigration massive d'Afrique a amené les vice-rois aux travailleurs de l'espace et aux travailleurs longue distance. En 2062, la Colonial Trade Commission a enquêté sur la popularité de la cigarette parmi les techniciens de l'environnement et sur une corrélation entre la part de marché croissante de la cigarette et l'augmentation des coûts de maintenance et des taux de défaillance des épurateurs de CO2. L'enquête est en cours, mais aucune mesure n'a été prise contre Sungura à ce sujet.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[146].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "eb32eb174fee7fd4aef214664186cc304cf8b616": {
        "source": "DataWIKISunguraViceroys",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKISunguraViceroys",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[146].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "59964df60620094b633600b977f63b11636f1145": {
        "source": "DataWIKISunguraViceroysMarketing",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKISunguraViceroysMarketing",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[146].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "59c3e0e4ad805436961951b941a72275c50231eb": {
        "source": "Sungura Viceroys Marketing",
        "translation": "Marketing des vice-rois de Sungura",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[147].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "62d208ba65627d2f8d7895bac25a2cc168b72a8d": {
        "source": "Viceroys' packaging and advertising often feature Sungura's mascot, the eponymous red hare, and the company's cast of stock characters. Though he is portrayed as a trickster, he is good natured and reasonable, and punishes pomposity. His ears form the red V in 'Viceroys' on the cigarette cartons.\n\nThe cigarette is filterless and rough. It presents itself as the preferred brand of smokers who want raw flavour after hard shift work. The brand's slogan 'Viceroy's orders' has become common parlance in working communities to mean a smoke break, often accompanied by a V hand gesture and/or thumb over the shoulder.",
        "translation": "Les emballages et la publicité de Viceroys présentent souvent la mascotte de Sungura, le lièvre rouge éponyme, ainsi que les personnages de base de l'entreprise. Bien qu'il soit décrit comme un filou, il est de bonne humeur et raisonnable, et punit l'emphase. Ses oreilles forment le V rouge des « Vice-rois » sur les cartouches de cigarettes.\n\nLa cigarette est sans filtre et rugueuse. Elle se présente comme la marque préférée des fumeurs qui recherchent une saveur brute après un dur travail posté. Le slogan de la marque « Ordres du vice-roi » est devenu un langage courant dans les communautés de travail pour désigner une pause cigarette, souvent accompagnée d'un geste de la main en V et/ou d'un pouce par-dessus l'épaule.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[147].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "49ab0bf6a72c6d40fb1d64fcdba8f8ed7340bb66": {
        "source": "DataWIKISunguraViceroys",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKISunguraViceroys",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[147].aInverse[0]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "e6823ec36dbfe46b8f55e4c2e5a6683b2f3ad3d7": {
        "source": "DataWIKISunguraViceroysHistory",
        "translation": "DonnéesWIKISunguraViceroisHistoire",
        "field": "aInverse",
        "path": "$[147].aInverse[1]",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "36214a6c41f7b8c934666756d2334f07dbdbc4ca": {
        "source": "Trenchers",
        "translation": "Trenchers",
        "field": "strTitle",
        "path": "$[148].strTitle",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "e927a2b723e7d694dac9c9fba9dfcf9137cda35b": {
        "source": "Trenchers are a trademarked brand of pre-packaged meals designed for long haul. They require no preparation, cleanup, and are designed to be usable under thrust or in microgravity. Taking after their namesake, most of the packaging is edible, although eating it is considered taboo among space workers.\n\nType: Long life food product\n<b>Manufacturer:</b> Future Foods Company\n<b>Country of origin:</b> Old United States\n<b>Ticker symbol:</b> FUFO\n\n<b>Slogans:</b>\nHungry enough to eat the table?\nAlmost too easy.\nYou can't say you aren't full.\n\"100% edible.\"",
        "translation": "Les trancheuses sont une marque déposée de repas préemballés conçus pour les longs trajets. Ils ne nécessitent aucune préparation, aucun nettoyage et sont conçus pour être utilisables sous poussée ou en microgravité. Tirant le nom de leur homonyme, la plupart des emballages sont comestibles, même si leur consommation est considérée comme taboue par les travailleurs de l'espace.\n\nType : Produit alimentaire de longue conservation\n<b>Fabricant :</b> Future Foods Company\n<b>Pays d'origine :</b> Anciens États-Unis\n<b>Symbole boursier :</b> FUFO\n\n<b>Slogans :</b>\nAssez faim pour manger à table ?\nPresque trop facile.\nVous ne pouvez pas dire que vous n'êtes pas rassasié.\n\"100% comestible.\"",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[148].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_datafiles.json"
    },
    "a71debe22ccf1856cde71ba5a4174686316f6707": {
        "source": "DataWIKITrenchersHistory",
