    "4571bb33eb25110a5a67122353c2e94650597ffa": {
        "source": "[us] [says] that [us-pos] friend [3rd] told [us-obj] that [them] was the person to see. [3rd-subj] said that [them] was a straight shooter. [3rd-subj] said [them] knew a good opportunity when [them-subj] saw one.",
        "translation": "[us] [says] cet ami de [us-pos] [3rd] a dit à [us-obj] que [them] était la personne à voir. [3rd-subj] a dit que [them] était un tireur hétéro. [3rd-subj] a déclaré que [them] connaissait une bonne opportunité lorsque [them-subj] en a vu une.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[18].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_fixer.json"
    },
