    "cf39237c2c12b4f1a1ba78cd9699173af7acb471": {
        "source": "[us] [stares] at [them] for a long moment before cracking a wide smile. [us] [says] that anyone crazy enough to hang with [3rd] must be good people. [us] [says] [them-subj] can browse [us-pos] wares at any time, so long as [them-subj] [knows] how to keep [them-pos] mouth shut.",
        "translation": "[us] [stares] à [them] pendant un long moment avant d'esquisser un large sourire. [us] [says] que toute personne assez folle pour traîner avec [3rd] doit être de bonnes personnes. [us] [says] [them-subj] peut parcourir les produits [us-pos] à tout moment, à condition que [them-subj] [knows] comment garder [them-pos] la bouche fermée.",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[19].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_fixer.json"
    },
