    "c281216d0bef4562056171181ccad578e1f0aea9": {
        "source": "[us] [says] that Officer [3rd] couldn't sniff out a crime ring no matter how bad it reeked. But even a dumb cop is bad for business, so [us] [accepts] [them-pos] proposal and [opens] up the market so long as [them-subj] can keep [3rd] away.",
        "translation": "[us] [says] que l'agent [3rd] ne pouvait pas détecter un réseau criminel, peu importe à quel point il puait. Mais même un flic stupide est mauvais pour les affaires, donc [us] [accepts] [them-pos] proposition et [opens] sur le marché tant que [them-subj] peut éloigner [3rd].",
        "field": "strDesc",
        "path": "$[23].strDesc",
        "relative_path": "interactions/interactions_fixer.json"
    },
    "933a4aec7a61c06424ae9a9d1f42342c3c6a1d78": {
