    },
    "a7afd7804c07e6da1ed0340a8c1dcda494fa48cf": {
        "source": "Negative [them-captain]. Your ship does not fit at our docking facility",
        "translation": "Négatif [them-captain]. Votre navire ne rentre pas dans notre installation d'amarrage",
