    "c6c021f0afd3b788d7713cb67aec5f2a108906a4": {
        "source": "[us] says ugh, I don't like your faction. But fine, let's talk favors.",
        "translation": "[us] dit pouah, je n'aime pas votre faction. Mais très bien, parlons des faveurs.",
